      "source": "https://www.shrewsburyhistoricalsociety.org/1"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Shrewsbury’s early industry included a leather factory in 1786 and later gunsmithing in 1797 that produced rifles and cutlery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
